        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi Akimelek aboŋokin eka baka ebe, “Iŋai kobulesinikon kere erai lomunot bala Daudi, loerai ekamuran loka ekabaka, ido erai lokapolon kotoma ainerunikon, erai da loka aibuses kotogokon? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
