            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lolo kereka ageunia eoŋ aiŋit Edeke kanuken? Madi akuj: kinyeik eka baka aibwaikin adiokirot mama ejai ekebulesit, karaida mama ejai ekek kere loka papaka: naarai mam ekonibulesit ejeŋi adioda kakiro kanun kere, nuikidioko arai nuipu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
