        {
          "text": " Kotema ckabaka iserikaleneke, luabwoete airimor ŋes atiar, “Kibelokinos, koarata isasedotin luka EJAKAIT; naarai ejaas akecekanin kaDaudi, naarai apotu kojenut ebe aker, komam ketejenunete eoŋ.” Konye koneroto ikejaanakinak luka ekabaka aikeun akan aiar isasedotin luka EJAKAIT, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
